meta {
  name: Academic
  seq: 12
}

docs {
  `AcademicController` - lookup over the Postgres `academic` table seeded by
  `weather-backend/database/create/academics-create.sql`.

  Postgres is optional. Set `ConnectionStrings:Academic` to enable it, for example:

  `dotnet user-secrets set ConnectionStrings:Academic "Host=127.0.0.1;Port=5432;Username=weather_user;Password=<password>;Database=weather" --project weather-backend`

  against the container in `weather-backend/database/docker-compose.yml`. Without
  a connection string the endpoint answers `503`. The container takes a while on
  first start to load the seed file and refuses TCP connections until it has.
}
